  "contentHtml": "&lt;재미있는&nbsp;과학수업&nbsp;만들기&gt;의&nbsp;수업관련자료들은&nbsp;선생님들의&nbsp;'협업'을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;공유되고&nbsp;있습니다.&nbsp;<br>수업을&nbsp;위한&nbsp;자료로만&nbsp;사용해주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;<br>**&nbsp;'말머리'&nbsp;에서&nbsp;해당단원을&nbsp;선택해주세요.&nbsp;수업자료를&nbsp;찾기&nbsp;쉬워집니다.**<br><br><br><br><strong>체세포&nbsp;분열&nbsp;나타내기&nbsp;입니다.</strong>&nbsp;<br>(상동염색체와&nbsp;염색분체의&nbsp;배열을&nbsp;잘&nbsp;나타내는가가&nbsp;주요&nbsp;포인트입니다.)<br><br><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2541C134580CFA9517\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"599\" height=\"636\" style=\"width: 599px; height: 636px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20141022_145232.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2541C134580CFA9517F1DA\"/><br><br><strong>생식세포분열&nbsp;나타내기&nbsp;입니다.</strong><br>(상동염색체의&nbsp;접합을&nbsp;표현해야&nbsp;하며,&nbsp;<br>1분열&nbsp;후기부터&nbsp;큰&nbsp;염색체와&nbsp;작은&nbsp;염색체의&nbsp;분리&nbsp;후&nbsp;색깔&nbsp;쌍을&nbsp;잘&nbsp;맞춰서&nbsp;이동시키는&nbsp;것이&nbsp;주요&nbsp;체크사항입니다.)<br><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2244D834580CFA9616\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"608\" height=\"465\" style=\"width: 608px; height: 465px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20141022_144703.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2244D834580CFA961654BA\"/><br><strong>선택은&nbsp;본인이&nbsp;하며&nbsp;<br>체세포&nbsp;분열&nbsp;35점&nbsp;만점<br>생식세포분열&nbsp;40점&nbsp;만점으로&nbsp;시험봅니다.<br></strong><br>하나&nbsp;틀린&nbsp;것까지는&nbsp;만점으로&nbsp;봐주며<br>체세포&nbsp;분열은&nbsp;1개&nbsp;틀릴&nbsp;때&nbsp;마다&nbsp;-5점&nbsp;최하&nbsp;20점<br>생식세포&nbsp;분열은&nbsp;2개&nbsp;틀릴&nbsp;때&nbsp;마다&nbsp;-5점&nbsp;최하&nbsp;20점<br><br>저희&nbsp;학교처럼&nbsp;전반적으로&nbsp;성적에&nbsp;연연하지&nbsp;않는&nbsp;녀석들에게&nbsp;<br>수행평가라도&nbsp;잘&nbsp;줘야겠다&nbsp;싶은&nbsp;경우에&nbsp;하면&nbsp;효과&nbsp;만점입니다.<br>이마저도&nbsp;안&nbsp;한다고&nbsp;버티는&nbsp;아이는&nbsp;똥꾸멍을&nbsp;살살&nbsp;긁고&nbsp;<br>\"너희가&nbsp;친구냐~~!!!\"&nbsp;며&nbsp;친구들을&nbsp;부추켜서&nbsp;가르쳐주라고&nbsp;한다음&nbsp;시험을&nbsp;봅니다.<br><br>그리고&nbsp;봉투에&nbsp;번호를&nbsp;써놔서&nbsp;어떤&nbsp;학생이&nbsp;무슨&nbsp;봉투로&nbsp;실험을&nbsp;했는지&nbsp;써&nbsp;놓습니다.<br>정리를&nbsp;제대로&nbsp;안&nbsp;할시&nbsp;태도&nbsp;감점&nbsp;시킵니다.<br><br>수행평가&nbsp;볼&nbsp;때&nbsp;미리&nbsp;다&nbsp;마치면&nbsp;들어가고&nbsp;못하고&nbsp;있는&nbsp;학생은&nbsp;오랫동안&nbsp;하는&nbsp;시스템으로&nbsp;운영하고&nbsp;있습니다.<br>수행평가는&nbsp;속도&nbsp;평가가&nbsp;아니라&nbsp;생각이&nbsp;들어서요...&nbsp;<br><br><br>아!!&nbsp;그리고&nbsp;각&nbsp;봉투에&nbsp;들어가는&nbsp;재료는...<br><br>체세포분열&nbsp;-&nbsp;색깔별로&nbsp;스템플러&nbsp;찍힌&nbsp;것&nbsp;2개씩,&nbsp;낱개&nbsp;4개,&nbsp;원&nbsp;3개,&nbsp;반원&nbsp;2개&nbsp;(총&nbsp;원&nbsp;4개)<br>생식세포분열&nbsp;-&nbsp;집게&nbsp;4개,&nbsp;색깔별로&nbsp;스템플러&nbsp;찍힌&nbsp;것&nbsp;6개,&nbsp;낱개&nbsp;4개,&nbsp;원&nbsp;3개,&nbsp;반원&nbsp;8개,&nbsp;1/4원&nbsp;4개&nbsp;(총&nbsp;원&nbsp;8개)</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2641CD34580CFA9817\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"372\" height=\"247\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 247px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20141029_114511.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2641CD34580CFA98172B26\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2741F234580CFA9A17\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"371\" height=\"252\" style=\"width: 371px; height: 252px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20141029_114533.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_2741F234580CFA9A17B6A8\"/><br><br>&nbsp;세포분열&nbsp;수행평가자료.hwp<br><br>&nbsp;세포분열&nbsp;수행평가채점표.hwp</p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
